rem Numbers with a Given Prime Factor Sum
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=618

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Top integer = 24

rem S(k) is the coefficient of x^k in
rem prod 1 / (1 - p x^p) over primes.
rem Each prime is an unbounded knapsack
rem g[j] += p g[j - p], taken a block
rem of p entries at a time since a
rem block reads the finished one before.
M = 1000000000
Fb = fibonacci to 1000000 array
Fb = Fb (0 till Top - 1)
K = Fb last
G = (0 to K) * 0
G 0 = 1
for P in primes to K
  for B in P to K by P
    Hi = (B + P) min (K + 1)
    Ds = P * G (B - P till Hi - P)
    G (B till Hi) = (G (B till Hi) + Ds) mod M
  end
end
Answer = (G Fb) sum mod M
Answer print
